# Build outputs the stages write at the repo root: content/ is the engine
# content converted by engine_bundle (tools/engine-convert/convert.ts),
# third_party/ holds the SF2 banks built from the tree's VAB instruments by
# music (tools/vab_to_sf2.py) and the HD lab. Regenerated, never committed.
/content/
/third_party/

